on. `applier._load_concurrency()` executes `_concurrency.py` by file path under the non-package key `_concurrency`, but `snapshot_head()` unconditionally executes `from rebar_reconciler import git_adapter`. In a supported installed in-process environment, the top-level package is intentionally absent.\n\n## Runtime Evidence\nA fresh process with `find_spec(\"rebar_reconciler\") is None` loaded `_concurrency.py` by file path, initialized a real temporary git repository, and called `snapshot_head(repo)`. It deterministically raised `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named rebar_reconciler` at `_concurrency.py:55`. `applier.py:268-278` is the production by-path loader.\n\n## Plan\n- Run rebar-debug independently to confirm legitimacy, loader identity requirements, and affected callers.\n- Add a RED oracle through the real `applier._load_concurrency()` path.\n- Restore standalone-safe git_adapter loading with the canonical dotted cache key, preserving package identity and snapshot semantics.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A by-path-loaded concurrency module resolves the current snapshot from a real temporary git repository without package-path seeding.\n- [ ] Package-context and standalone execution share one canonical git_adapter module object.\n- [ ] Existing concurrency and applier suites pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["reconciler","import","concurrency"],"ticket_id":"b0a8-5496-d178-40a9","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Standalone concurrency loader cannot import git adapter","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["46b77120-e297-432e-9151-ab622d6d5c20","bfcb7326-4ace-4c0e-b970-488e949b26d2"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787047743075125002,"uuid":"e1e1d994-c6ac-4993-aca0-d23dc0439ce8"}